[i]It's almost evening. The sun is getting lower in the sky, though you can't actually see it through the rain.[/i]
[i]There is a firm knock on the front door. Only one knock.[/i]
[i]You make your way to the front door and look through the peephole.[/i]
[i]A man stands there. He stands knowing that one knock was enough to get your attention.[/i]
- Open the door.
- He seems trustworthy enough. Monks are nice, right?
- I let in the other two, so I might as well.
[i]You open the door. The man seems glad.[/i]
FoShi (Default): “Greetings, friend. May I come in?”
- "I don't see why not."
	Player (Default): "I don't see why not. It's not great outside."
	FoShi (Happy): "Thank you, friend."
- "Sure. I imagine the rain isn't too nice to be in."
	Player (Default): "Sure. I imagine the rain isn't too nice to be in."
	FoShi (Happy): "Thank you, friend."
- "For now. I want to talk with you to make sure you won't cause any trouble."
	Player (Default): "For now. I want to talk with you to make sure you won't cause any trouble."
	FoShi (Default): "I can assure you that I have no bad intentions. I simply wish to find shelter for this rainstorm."
[i]The man enters the building and looks around the lobby before sitting down at the dining table.[/i]
FoShi (Default): "Have a seat. I would like to talk."
Player (Default): "Talk about what?"
FoShi (Default): "I simply wish for you to know me better. A host should know their guests, don't you agree?"
[i]You sit down at the table across from him.[/i]
label inital_convo
- "Who are you?" | [if {Timeline_Managment.foshi_who1_1} == 0.0] [else="hide"]
	Player (Default): "Who are you?"
	FoShi (Default): “A monk is all I am and all I aspire to be, for a monk is he who seeks peace in the turbulence of life, and peace can never be fully attained."
	FoShi (Default): "Indeed, though I know peace, I also know that I do not know peace; after all, there is an infinite distance between peace and life."
	FoShi (Default): This distance is never able to be crossed in a lifetime alone unless one transcends the dimension on which life, death, and the body exists; in other words—enlightenment."
	Player (Angry): "I was kinda just asking for your name."
	FoShi (Shock): "Oh? You just want my name? I am {FoShi.name}.”
	set {Timeline_Managment.foshi_who1_1} = 1.0
	[signal arg="3000"]
	jump inital_convo
- "Where are you from?" | [if {Timeline_Managment.foshi_where_from1_1} == 0.0] [else="hide"]
	Player (Default): "Where are you from?"
	FoShi (Default): “A difficult question to answer. From a geographical view, I came from the woods to the north, and beyond that, {FoShi.from}. Mentally, I come from a state of anguish and reproach."
	FoShi (Frustrated): "Spiritually, I come from the stream of rebirth—old energy in a new body; and biologically, I come from my parents."
	FoShi (Default): "However, I see that none of these are the answers that you seek. I understand. You wish to know my home, yes?"
	FoShi (Default): "Well, I have traveled far and wide these lonesome lands, seen all that humanity has become—dictators, cruelty masquerading as kindness, exclusivity of others…"
	FoShi (Default): "In recent times, I have not called a place home; rather, the world has become my home.”
	Player (Angry): "You do talk a lot, don't you?"
	FoShi (Default): "I simply seek to give you an accurate picture of who I am."
	[signal arg="3001"]
	set {Timeline_Managment.foshi_where_from1_1} = 1.0
	jump inital_convo
- "Is that a bald cap on your head?" | [if {Timeline_Managment.foshi_bald1_1} == 0.0] [else="hide"]
	Player (Default): "Is that a bald cap on your head?"
	FoShi (Happy): “Indeed. Hair is a detriment to the enlightenment of the soul. To wear baldness is to forsake pride, ego, and vanity. If you wish to begin your journey toward nirvana, I will lend you baldness.”
	Player (Default): “No thanks, but why a bald cap? Why not just go bald?”
	FoShi (Default): “A barber is hard to find in these apocalyptic times. One must make do with what he can find. Are you sure you don’t want a bald cap? They are quite warm.”
	Player (Default): “I’m sure. Thanks.”
	set {Timeline_Managment.foshi_bald1_1} = 1.0
	jump inital_convo
- "What did you do before everything happened?" | [if {Timeline_Managment.foshi_past_doing1_1} == 0.0] [else="hide"]
	Player (Default): "What did you do before everything happened?"
	FoShi (Default): “I was a student yet to realize the path to peace, favoring pursuit of knowledge over cultivation of the mind. Though I will not say I was foolish, I cannot deny I was ignorant.”
	FoShi (Default): "I believed that academics would propel me through life; I did not understand that life is more than status, wealth, and recognition.”
	Player (Default): "You were a student? What did you study?"
	FoShi (Default): “I was a practitioner in the art of physics. Those days, the secrets of the universe were all that occupied my mind. Indeed, I had not yet understood the synchronicity of self and world."
	FoShi (Default): "That is, to cultivate the self is to unravel the world, but to learn oneself requires understanding the world.”
	set {Timeline_Managment.foshi_past_doing1_1} = 1.0
	jump inital_convo
- "What have you been doing recently?" | [if {Timeline_Managment.foshi_current_doing1_1} == 0.0] [else="hide"]
	Player (Default): "What have you been doing recently?"
	FoShi (Sad): “There was a moment, months ago, when I… became a monster. I tell myself it was not me in control that night, but… ahem! I wish to rid myself of the karma accrued that day."
	FoShi (Sad): "Since then, I’ve been searching for peace in nature and the cold remnants of humanity. Aiding others and understanding the nature of being are my current priorities.”
	Player (Default): “Can you tell me more about the incident?”
	FoShi (Sad): “It was a night of crimson. I will not speak more of it.”
	set {Timeline_Managment.foshi_current_doing1_1} = 1.0
	jump inital_convo
- "I believe that I know you well enough."
Player (Default): "I believe that I know you well enough now. You can stay here."
FoShi (Happy): "Thank you, my friend. I will not betray your trust."
[i]{FoShi.name} walks over to another part of the lobby and sits down. He seems to be doing some sort of meditation.[/i]
[i]You go to your room to start preparing dinner, now cooking for 3 more than usual.[/i]